<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Caregiver Wellness Passport — Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'wellness-passport' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero py-56-64">
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <h1 class="hero-title-clamp">Caregiver Wellness Passport</h1>
    <p class="lede">A way for caregivers to engage in wellness activities, Legacy programs, community experiences, and participating Community Wellness Partner locations.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="passport" class="py-56-64">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Program Structure</span>
      <h2>How the Caregiver Wellness Passport Works</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="muted measure-660">A single pass connecting caregivers to wellness experiences across the community. Passport participation is structured around five key areas:</p>

    <div class="card-grid grid-autofit-240 mt-32">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>1. Wellness Activities</h3>
        <p>Restorative experiences and dedicated wellness opportunities designed to support caregiver health and personal restoration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>2. Caregiver Sanctuary Program Participation</h3>
        <p>Participation in Caregiver Sanctuary programs including virtual support groups, Memory Socials, respite, and family education.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>3. Community Wellness Partner Experiences</h3>
        <p>Welcoming spaces and community experiences hosted in partnership with local businesses and organizations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>4. Engagement Tracking</h3>
        <p>Tracking participation across programs, wellness activities, and partner locations to support your caregiving journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>5. Wellness Grant Eligibility</h3>
        <p>Wellness Grant eligibility as a benefit of participation. Active participation opens eligibility to apply for a personalized wellness stipend.</p>
        <div class="mt-16-util">
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-plum btn-sm" data-action="open-grant-apply">Apply for a Wellness Grant</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_membership-modal.html.j2' %}
{% include '_grant-apply-modal.html.j2' %}
{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
